<title>POLAND: Polish average wage rises to PLN 1,192 in July.</title>
<headline>Polish average wage rises to PLN 1,192 in July.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average wages in Poland's enterprise sector rose to 1,192 zlotys in July from 1,172 zlotys in June and was 23.2 percent higher than a year ago, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p> POLISH AVERAGE WAGES	 JULY	 JUNE    JULY 1996</p>
<p> average mthly wage PLN     1,191     1,172	 967</p>
